# SHA-256 of every lane-persona.js that lane-control shipped before the current one. A project-level install brings
# an existing user-level copy up to date only when its bytes are one of these (adapter.py, SHIPPED_HASHES); a copy
# that differs, such as one with a local edit, is left as it is and named in the output.
# When the plugin changes: move the hash on the `current` line below into this list (it is now an older version), then
# write the new file's `sha256sum` as `current`. tests/test_harnesses.py fails until that is done.
7ebab0d47da9dac235ac4326b2f6fb2f265b1b492430d9b89314e9d152ca3d32  # the first release (NO-1)
current dc64d89dc505e63c6a8a8a7bd83158fad2e65c8b80bb1b502cb88c8a9ec27497  # the plugin in this tree (UP-6: project-level install, persona added once)
